# Zones which are built and published but which the renderers should not load.
#
# One zone name per line. Say why, and date it: a zone with no reason recorded
# stays inactive long after anyone remembers what the reason was, which is how
# zone-tekan came to have five years of published data that was never drawn.
#
# Leaving a zone out of the render is not the same as retiring it. To stop
# building a zone at all, move its squares out of osm-squares; its published
# output then stays as it was and nothing regenerates it.

# The four zones whose source contour squares are lost. Their derived output is
# still on the old server and none of them is in the render today, so nothing
# changes by leaving them out - but the new process cannot reproduce them until
# their squares are recovered, and rendering data that cannot be rebuilt is how
# it came to be lost in the first place.
#
# mergany and udzdanarat can be recovered from their published .hgt, the way
# roantra and tekan were on 2026-08-22. izaland and kojo have no .hgt either,
# so their only surviving copy is raw.tif inside their published tiff zip.
#
# The wiki also lists udzdanarat as inactive on its own account.
izaland
kojo
mergany
udzdanarat
